{"seq":1,"slug":"cell-biology","title":"细胞生物学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/cell-molecular/cell-biology","wordCount":1361,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"细胞生物学\">细胞生物学</h1><p>细胞是生命的基本结构和功能单位。从最简单的细菌到最复杂的人体神经元，所有生物体都由细胞构成。细胞生物学研究细胞的结构、功能、增殖和通讯机制，是理解一切生命现象的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p><strong>细胞的基本类型</strong>：生物界的细胞分为两大类——原核细胞和真核细胞。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>原核细胞</th>\n<th>真核细胞</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>细胞核</td>\n<td>无核膜（拟核）</td>\n<td>有核膜包被的细胞核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>细胞器</td>\n<td>缺乏膜性细胞器</td>\n<td>具有丰富的膜性细胞器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基因组</td>\n<td>环形 DNA，少组蛋白</td>\n<td>线性染色体，组蛋白包装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大小</td>\n<td>通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\ \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>m</td>\n<td>通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\ \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表</td>\n<td>细菌、古菌</td>\n<td>动物、植物、真菌、原生生物</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>细胞膜</strong>：细胞膜是由磷脂双分子层构成的半透膜，嵌有蛋白质和胆固醇。流动镶嵌模型（Singer-Nicolson，1972）描述了膜的动态结构。膜蛋白可分为整合蛋白（跨膜）和外周蛋白（附着于表面），它们执行物质转运、信号传导和细胞识别等功能。</p>\n<p><strong>物质跨膜转运</strong>的方式包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>被动运输</strong>：沿浓度梯度方向，不消耗 ATP。包括简单扩散（如 O<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4511em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、CO<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4511em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）和易化扩散（通过通道蛋白或载体蛋白）。</li>\n<li><strong>主动运输</strong>：逆浓度梯度，消耗 ATP。如 Na<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/K<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-ATPase 每消耗一个 ATP 泵出 3 个 Na<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、泵入 2 个 K<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>囊泡转运</strong>：大分子通过内吞（胞吞）或外排（胞吐）进出细胞。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>细胞器功能</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>细胞器</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>细胞核</td>\n<td>DNA 储存、转录调控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线粒体</td>\n<td>氧化磷酸化（产生 ATP）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内质网</td>\n<td>蛋白质折叠（粗面 ER）、脂质合成（光面 ER）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高尔基体</td>\n<td>蛋白质修饰、分选、包装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>溶酶体</td>\n<td>细胞内消化（含水解酶，pH <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过氧化物酶体</td>\n<td>脂肪酸氧化、过氧化氢分解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叶绿体</td>\n<td>光合作用（仅植物细胞）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"细胞周期与有丝分裂\">细胞周期与有丝分裂</h3><p>细胞周期包括间期（G<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4511em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> → S → G<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4511em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）和分裂期（M 期）。S 期进行 DNA 复制，M 期进行有丝分裂。</p>\n<p>有丝分裂分为前期、前中期、中期、后期和末期。纺锤体将复制的染色体精确地分配到两个子细胞。检查点机制（G<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4511em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/S、G<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4511em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/M 和纺锤体组装检查点）确保细胞只在 DNA 完好无损且复制完成后才进入下一阶段。</p>\n<p><strong>周期蛋白-CDK 复合物</strong>驱动细胞周期的推进。周期蛋白（Cyclin）的浓度周期性波动，与对应的 CDK（周期蛋白依赖性激酶）结合后磷酸化下游底物，推动细胞通过各个检查点。p53 蛋白是&quot;基因组守卫者&quot;——当 DNA 受损时，p53 激活 p21 抑制 CDK 活性，阻止细胞周期推进，给予修复时间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"减数分裂与遗传多样性\">减数分裂与遗传多样性</h3><p>减数分裂产生单倍体配子（精子和卵子），包含两次连续分裂：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>减数分裂 I</strong>：同源染色体配对（联会）、交叉互换（crossing over）、同源染色体分离。这是多样性的主要来源——交叉互换重组亲本基因，独立分配产生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>23</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{23}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">23</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（约 800 万）种不同的配子。</li>\n<li><strong>减数分裂 II</strong>：类似有丝分裂，姐妹染色单体分离。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"细胞信号传导\">细胞信号传导</h3><p>细胞通过信号分子（配体）与受体的结合来接收外界信息。主要的信号通路包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>G 蛋白偶联受体（GPCR）</strong>：配体结合 → G 蛋白激活 → 第二信使（cAMP、IP<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4511em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、DAG）→ 效应蛋白。</li>\n<li><strong>受体酪氨酸激酶（RTK）</strong>：配体结合 → 二聚化 → 自磷酸化 → Ras-MAPK 级联 → 基因表达。</li>\n<li><strong>离子通道受体</strong>：配体结合直接开启离子通道（如神经肌肉接头的乙酰胆碱受体）。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[细胞生物学] --&gt; B[细胞结构]&#10;    A --&gt; C[细胞周期]&#10;    A --&gt; D[信号传导]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[细胞膜与转运]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[细胞器功能]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[有丝分裂]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[减数分裂]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[周期调控]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[GPCR 通路]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[RTK-MAPK]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[离子通道]\">graph TD\n    A[细胞生物学] --&gt; B[细胞结构]\n    A --&gt; C[细胞周期]\n    A --&gt; D[信号传导]\n    B --&gt; B1[细胞膜与转运]\n    B --&gt; B2[细胞器功能]\n    C --&gt; C1[有丝分裂]\n    C --&gt; C2[减数分裂]\n    C --&gt; C3[周期调控]\n    D --&gt; D1[GPCR 通路]\n    D --&gt; D2[RTK-MAPK]\n    D --&gt; D3[离子通道]</pre><h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>比较有丝分裂和减数分裂的异同。为什么有性生殖的物种需要减数分裂？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Na<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/K<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-ATPase 为什么每个循环泵出 3 个 Na<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 但只泵入 2 个 K<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>？这种不对称性有什么生理意义？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>癌症常被称为&quot;细胞周期失控&quot;。p53 基因突变为什么特别危险？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>光面内质网和粗面内质网的功能差异反映了什么样的细胞需求？举例说明不同细胞类型中两者的比例差异。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>胰岛素信号通过 RTK 通路传导。从受体到最终效应（葡萄糖转运蛋白 GLUT4 转位到细胞膜），画出大致的信号传导链。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Alberts 等《Molecular Biology of the Cell》——细胞生物学的百科全书式教材，被称为&quot;细胞生物学圣经&quot;。</li>\n<li>翟中和等《细胞生物学》（高等教育出版社）——国内标准教材，结构清晰。</li>\n<li>Lodish 等《Molecular Cell Biology》——分子与细胞生物学的整合教材。</li>\n<li>Pollard &amp; Earnshaw《Cell Biology》——侧重细胞骨架和运动，图文并茂。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>细胞生物学揭示了生命在最基本层面的运作机制。从细胞膜的选择性通透到线粒体的能量转换，从有丝分裂的精确染色体分配到信号通路的级联放大，每一个细胞过程都精巧而高效。理解细胞，就是理解生命的基本逻辑。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"细胞生物学","id":"细胞生物学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"细胞周期与有丝分裂","id":"细胞周期与有丝分裂"},{"level":3,"text":"减数分裂与遗传多样性","id":"减数分裂与遗传多样性"},{"level":3,"text":"细胞信号传导","id":"细胞信号传导"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"分子生物学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/cell-molecular/molecular-biology"}}